# The counter-standoff arm (log 2026-09-10): the VH champion with the
# siege switch at 4,500 samples -- one c_artillery share joins the
# production ratio only once a match has outlived the winning regime
# (wins bank by ~3,100 samples), so the 78 percent of games that close
# early never pay the tempo cost that bred artillery out of the fixed
# mix. Aimed at the measured ten-loss anatomy: two-thirds ground
# standoff, enemy c_artillery the single largest killer. One field.
